162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Romy sewing pattern is available as a top and a short A-line dress. It comes in two versions: a plain one and one with a scalloped hem. It's a simple model with beautiful finishes to wear all year round. For the dress, you can choose a lined finish or opt for a facing. You can simply pair it with a pretty pair of open shoes in summer or as a pinafore dress for fall/winter to layer over your most beautiful blouses. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Romy sewing pattern has a different size range than usual \(32 to 50 - 2 to 12\) since, exceptionally, this model is available from 32 to 42 \(2 to 12\). Why this difference? Its cut does not allow it to fit beyond 42 \(12\). I therefore preferred to reduce the size range rather than offer a model whose result would not be convincing.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
